{"id":"n50926-2-5","stage":4,"title":"뒹굴다 · 游手好闲","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50926-2-5-1","ko":"요즘 자꾸 살이 쪄서 고민이야.","zh":"最近我越来越胖，真让人头疼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살이","meaning":"皮肤","explanation":"살：皮肤；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"4","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쪄서","meaning":"发胖，长膘","explanation":"찌다：发胖，长膘；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"찌다","audio":"/audio/22c11459d6526bb8d7a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62375","senseId":"1","lemma":"찌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고민이야.","meaning":"苦闷，苦恼，烦恼","explanation":"고민：苦闷，苦恼，烦恼；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"고민","audio":"/audio/2d27a95090cbb6802399.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19225","senseId":"1","lemma":"고민","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"皮肤","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"66883","definition":"人或动物的外皮表面。","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"22c11459d6526bb8","term":"찌다","zh":"发胖，长膘","audio":"/audio/22c11459d6526bb8d7a9.mp3","entryId":"62375","definition":"身上长肉变胖。","pronunciation":["찌다"]},{"id":"2d27a95090cbb680","term":"고민","zh":"苦闷，苦恼，烦恼","audio":"/audio/2d27a95090cbb6802399.mp3","entryId":"19225","definition":"心里有烦心事而痛苦，一直在意。","pronunciation":["고민"]}],"audio":"/audio/924d0d087e1a3f12c6b2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n50926-2-5-2","ko":"매일 하는 일 없이 소파에서 뒹굴어 다니니까 그렇지.","zh":"因为每天没事可做，就在沙发上懒洋洋地躺来躺去，所以才会这样啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"매일","meaning":"每日，天天","explanation":"매일：每日，天天","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58103","senseId":"1","lemma":"매일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없이","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없이：没有","readings":[{"term":"없이","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89918","senseId":"9","lemma":"없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소파에서","meaning":"沙发","explanation":"소파：沙发；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"소파","audio":"/audio/d6dab8e7a021c768cde2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62508","senseId":"1","lemma":"소파","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒹굴어","meaning":"游手好闲","explanation":"뒹굴다：游手好闲；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"뒹굴다","audio":"/audio/0d5348a586d6da2d67f5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50926","senseId":"2","lemma":"뒹굴다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다니니까","meaning":"常去","explanation":"다니다：常去；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"1","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇지.","meaning":"那样，一般","explanation":"그렇다：那样，一般；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"5","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5d6a44c9a892452","term":"매일","zh":"每日，天天","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3","entryId":"58103","definition":"一天一天的每一天。","pronunciation":["매ː일"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"c4b723256abd5d51","term":"없이","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3","entryId":"89918","definition":"理由或可能性等不成立地。","pronunciation":["업ː씨"]},{"id":"d6dab8e7a021c768","term":"소파","zh":"沙发","audio":"/audio/d6dab8e7a021c768cde2.mp3","entryId":"62508","definition":"可以背靠着坐的又长又软的椅子。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"0d5348a586d6da2d","term":"뒹굴다","zh":"游手好闲","audio":"/audio/0d5348a586d6da2d67f5.mp3","entryId":"50926","definition":"没有特别的事要做，只是打发时间。","pronunciation":["뒹굴다"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"常去","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"经常出入某个地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，一般","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"不好或不太满意。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/5fce8a50f32c3c76157a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.117,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=50926","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":143,"sequenceScore":2.8423,"questions"